  "updatedAt": "2026-10-18T21:23:22.706601Z",
  "totalBlocks": 30,
  "translatedBlocks": 29,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c5b814e4ff6c521",
      "translationZh": "继 club-5060ti 和 club-rdna16 之后，我整合推出了 Infermeld：一个小型、开源的 Linux 配套工具包，由 llama.cpp 驱动，用于让一个 GGUF 在一块 AMD GPU 和一块 NVIDIA GPU 上协同运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c58dc114775af2f",
      "translationZh": "我是维护者。这是一个实验性的 v0.1.0 版本，我正在寻找拥有其他混合 GPU 组合的用户，帮助复现这套配置并找出尚不完善之处。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "400fcf23567160a4",
      "translationZh": "这个想法很务实：如果你已经拥有这两家厂商的显卡，能否让它们协同工作，而不必再购买一对相互匹配的显卡？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4bee98e906cd6ac",
      "translationZh": "推理引擎是 llama.cpp。Infermeld 并不是一个新的后端，我也并未声称自己发明了混合 GPU 推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a6a748f654a1cf4",
      "translationZh": "它将这套配置所需的配套组件打包在一起：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e6f2f0294dbe999b",
      "translationZh": "显式选择 AMD/Vulkan + NVIDIA/CUDA 设备，并进行运行时预检。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7a90c2b218739d91",
      "translationZh": "可复现的构建说明，以及可检查的启动参数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b504a3a17bd022a1",
      "translationZh": "只读的温度保护机制，其关闭操作仅限于它所启动的服务器进程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bdda29271bb486e6",
      "translationZh": "提供文档和结果网站，让配置、失败情况和局限性保持公开可见。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6240a6cb5421959",
      "translationZh": "此次发布仅提供源代码。你需要单独构建文档中指定的 llama.cpp 修订版本，并自行提供模型权重。它面向能够适应实验性 Linux 环境的用户，并非一键安装程序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9d494b8529e3db5",
      "translationZh": "组件 已测试配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d500d2e621d4461",
      "translationZh": "验收检查包括在关闭和开启 MTP 的情况下进行加载和短文本补全。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af2421722a3a6166",
      "translationZh": "这只是针对一组硬件组合得出的有限结果，并非广泛的兼容性测试。预留 8K 上下文空间不等于测试填满 8K 的提示词，而一次成功的简短响应也不等于持续性能基准测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e6c9573e5a701387",
      "translationZh": "持续 Q4 吞吐量和长上下文下的全长度结果尚未通过验证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a0cf92bd0904a5b9",
      "translationZh": "历史测量结果均标注了其原始配置，不应将其视为当前 Q4 配置的性能数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a6d212f8ef688a91",
      "translationZh": "不能保证组合使用多张显卡比使用单张更快。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bedbe594fa93650c",
      "translationZh": "将标称的 VRAM 容量相加，并不保证这些容量都能用于模型及其运行时的内存分配。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73615d67265894b2",
      "translationZh": "我宁愿把这些局限说清楚，也不愿将一次成功加载当作完整的基准测试来呈现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e30625eeb1753084",
      "translationZh": "寻找其他 AMD/NVIDIA 组合",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8544d81caaec123",
      "translationZh": "成功运行和失败的结果都有价值。如果你尝试了，请提供以下信息：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9bbc3a2c7b9d1cf1",
      "translationZh": "两张 GPU 的型号及各自的 VRAM 容量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0b2087e98a9864bd",
      "translationZh": "OS、驱动版本和 llama.cpp 修订版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "64190e86422428fd",
      "translationZh": "模型和量化方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c2501f1175d801a1",
      "translationZh": "启动设置，包括拆分方式和上下文预留。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "99d221b7bf096db5",
      "translationZh": "运行到了哪一步：预检、加载、首次生成完成，还是运行了更长时间的工作负载。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5435c48b27e3cadb",
      "translationZh": "仓库中有一个硬件/结果问题反馈表。请对路径进行脱敏，并避免在报告中包含凭据和私密日志。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d0409dbc7a7be4b",
      "translationZh": "仓库和配置说明：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ee21c7e4ca62acf",
      "translationZh": "有人已经在使用 AMD/NVIDIA 组合进行本地推理了吗？我很想了解哪些做法对你有效，以及这套配置在不同硬件上会在哪些地方出问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4fbe1a6124fbb7a3",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/do_u_think_im_spooky 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
